│  📁 Azure Blob (CSV)     🗄️ Azure SQL      📊 Delta Lake   │
│  🔄 Auto-detects:          🔄 Auto-detects:   🔄 Auto-detects:│
│  • File manifest + hash    • CDC / Watermark  • Delta CDF    │
│  • Partition by date       • SCD Type 2       • Time travel   │
│  • Idempotent by file      • MERGE upsert     • OPTIMIZE      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    ▼
         SAME PLANNER → SAME GATES → SAME EXECUTOR
                    ▼
         SOURCE-SPECIFIC CODE GENERATED AUTOMATICALLY
```

### **No More Source-Specific Code in Planner**

The planner **only knows about `IncrementalConfig`**. It doesn't care if it's SQL, Blob, Delta, or API. The **strategy compiler** handles the details.

---

## **WHAT THIS UNLOCKS**

| Scenario | Before (SQL-only) | After (Source-Agnostic) |
|----------|-------------------|-------------------------|
| **Daily CSV drops in Blob** | ❌ Manual full reload | ✅ Auto-detect new files, append partition |
| **Hourly API sync** | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Cursor pagination, rate limit handling |
| **Streaming IoT** | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Kafka offset management, exactly-once |
| **Delta Lake CDC** | ❌ Full refresh | ✅ Native CDF, SCD Type 2, OPTIMIZE |
| **Multi-source pipeline** | ❌ Separate logic | ✅ Unified orchestration, single DAG |

